2026"}, {"t0": 141.572, "s": "watch", "y": "No one knows the day"}, {"t0": 144.823, "s": "skyopen", "y": "No one knows the day"}, {"t0": 148.538, "s": "return", "y": "No one knows the day"}, {"t0": 152.718, "s": "king", "y": "No one knows the day"}, {"t0": 156.897, "s": "diptych2", "y": "Eden \u2192 Eternity"}, {"t0": 161.077, "s": "nations", "y": "Every nation"}, {"t0": 164.792, "s": "book", "y": "through the years"}, {"t0": 168.507, "s": "king", "y": "Forevermore"}, {"t0": 172.222, "s": "city", "y": "Eternity"}, {"t0": 183.832, "s": "end", "y": "Eternity"}], "LY": [{"text": "In a garden, light and breath, Adam, Eve, the first of men", "a": 14.5, "b": 21.29}, {"text": "One bite fell, the gates were closed, but a promise rose again", "a": 21.5, "b": 28.26}, {"text": "Abraham looked up at stars, Moses split the sea in two", "a": 28.4, "b": 35.23}, {"text": "David sang, the prophets cried, a King is coming, wait for Him", "a": 35.3, "b": 43.0}, {"text": "From the garden to the cross", "a": 45.2, "b": 48.69}, {"text": "From the cross to every shore", "a": 48.7, "b": 52.4}, {"text": "One name carried through the years", "a": 52.4, "b": 56.12}, {"text": "Jesus, now and evermore", "a": 56.2, "b": 60.6}, {"text": "Bethlehem, a child is born, heaven sings above the hay", "a": 66.4, "b": 70.4}, {"text": "Healed the blind and calmed the storm, then the cross, the darkest day", "a": 70.4, "b": 73.77}, {"text": "Three days on, the stone was rolled, death itself could not hold on", "a": 74.0, "b": 77.48}, {"text": "Go to all the world, He said, and the fire fell on them", "a": 77.7, "b": 84.2}, {"text": "From the garden to the cross", "a": 84.4, "b": 87.7}, {"text": "From the cross to every shore", "a": 87.8, "b": 91.7}, {"text": "One name carried through the years", "a": 91.7, "b": 95.13}, {"text": "Jesus, now and evermore", "a": 95.2, "b": 99.31}, {"text": "Paul set sail on Roman roads, lions could not stop the word", "a": 116.0, "b": 123.9}, {"text": "Empires fell and it kept on, every tongue and tribe has heard", "a": 123.9, "b": 130.8}, {"text": "Monks with ink and ships with sails, pages printed, chains undone", "a": 130.8, "b": 134.61}, {"text": "From Jerusalem it spread to the ends of all the earth", "a": 134.8, "b": 141.2}, {"text": "No one knows the day or hour", "a": 141.6, "b": 144.82}, {"text": "But the sky will open wide", "a": 145.0, "b": 148.4}, {"text": "Every eye will see Him come", "a": 148.4, "b": 152.5}, {"text": "The King returns for His bride", "a": 152.5, "b": 156.8}, {"text": "From the garden to the throne", "a": 156.8, "b": 161.0}, {"text": "Every nation, every shore", "a": 161.0, "b": 164.79}, {"text": "One name carried through the years", "a": 165.0, "b": 168.51}, {"text": "Jesus, King forevermore", "a": 168.6, "b": 175.94}, {"text": "Come, Lord Jesus", "a": 176.0, "b": 183.8}, {"text": "Come, Lord Jesus", "a": 183.8, "b": 199.88}], "total": 199.88, "per": 0.4643986013986014, "ph": 0.395}